  "title": "《KINGDOM》 趙亭婷x安娜琪舞蹈劇場",
  "html": "\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull work-detail has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"wp-block-group alignwide work-detail__layout is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n\t\t\n\t\t<div class=\"wp-block-group work-detail__header is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n\t\t\t<h1 class=\"work-detail__title wp-block-post-title\">《KINGDOM》 趙亭婷x安娜琪舞蹈劇場</h1>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"taxonomy-work_category work-detail__categories wp-block-post-terms\"><a href=\"/work-category/live/\" rel=\"tag\">LIVE</a></div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\n\t\t<figure data-cover-orientation=\"landscape\" class=\"work-detail__hero wp-block-post-featured-image\"><img width=\"2400\" height=\"1600\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/kingdom-cover.webp\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-post-image\" alt=\"《KINGDOM》趙亭婷 x 安娜琪舞蹈劇場演出現場\" style=\"object-fit:cover;\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/kingdom-cover.webp 2400w, /wp-content/uploads/2026/08/kingdom-cover-300x200.webp 300w, /wp-content/uploads/2026/08/kingdom-cover-1024x683.webp 1024w, /wp-content/uploads/2026/08/kingdom-cover-768x512.webp 768w, /wp-content/uploads/2026/08/kingdom-cover-1536x1024.webp 1536w, /wp-content/uploads/2026/08/kingdom-cover-2048x1365.webp 2048w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 2400px) 100vw, 2400px\" /></figure>\n\n\t\t\n\t\t<div class=\"wp-block-group work-detail__content has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-content work-detail__post-content wp-block-post-content has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-post-content-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Description</h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">在虛擬世界中，空間與時間被切割、壓縮與延展，彷彿成了一層層可被讀取的切片，身體不再有固定的位置，而是跟隨著失衡的記憶斷層，懸浮在虛實之間。</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">身處於網路與數位技術高速發展的世代，我們早已熟練地運用各式媒介捕捉與記錄周遭事物。然而，在這樣不斷更新的洪流中，《KINGDOM》正試圖邀請觀眾，一同回望那些被遺落、被忽視、被淘汰的事物。那些日常的顯而易見，正是我們不曾記得的，也正是如此它長出了自己的個性、色調與溫度。</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">《KINGDOM》是一場XR跨域共構的實驗性表演作品，結合了3D掃描技術與動態捕捉系統於VR之中，透過現場多螢幕的拼湊與舞者的身體語彙，將破碎、液化且不完整的物件掃描檔案，構築出一座無人居住的數位王國，在不斷崩解與重組的數位環境裡，不停地適應新的認知與環境。</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Awards</h2>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>入圍第24屆台新藝術獎</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"work-media\"><section class=\"work-media__section work-media-gallery\" aria-labelledby=\"work-media-gallery-28\"><h2 id=\"work-media-gallery-28\" class=\"work-media__heading\">Gallery</h2><div class=\"work-media-gallery__grid\"><figure class=\"work-media-gallery__item\"><img width=\"1024\" height=\"312\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/10vveM-aouWZqyEI0J2H7fXDeT2XIM-AG-1024x312.webp\" class=\"work-media-gallery__image\" alt=\"《KINGDOM》 趙亭婷x安娜琪舞蹈劇場 — credit.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/10vveM-aouWZqyEI0J2H7fXDeT2XIM-AG-1024x312.webp 1024w, /wp-content/uploads/2026/08/10vveM-aouWZqyEI0J2H7fXDeT2XIM-AG-300x92.webp 300w, /wp-content/uploads/2026/08/10vveM-aouWZqyEI0J2H7fXDeT2XIM-AG-768x234.webp 768w, /wp-content/uploads/2026/08/10vveM-aouWZqyEI0J2H7fXDeT2XIM-AG-1536x469.webp 1536w, /wp-content/uploads/2026/08/10vveM-aouWZqyEI0J2H7fXDeT2XIM-AG.webp 1891w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" /></figure><figure class=\"work-media-gallery__item\"><img width=\"819\" height=\"1024\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1uQKc_JlBP-EuOUAkVnM9wVMZYwar931n-819x1024.webp\" class=\"work-media-gallery__image\" alt=\"《KINGDOM》 趙亭婷x安娜琪舞蹈劇場 — SnapInsta.to_571413236_841694015179750_2582012147598559308_n.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1uQKc_JlBP-EuOUAkVnM9wVMZYwar931n-819x1024.webp 819w, /wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1uQKc_JlBP-EuOUAkVnM9wVMZYwar931n-240x300.webp 240w, /wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1uQKc_JlBP-EuOUAkVnM9wVMZYwar931n-768x960.webp 768w, /wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1uQKc_JlBP-EuOUAkVnM9wVMZ